- Walrus Foundation legal formation status, jurisdiction, and initial board — announced as planned, no public filing
- WAL token launch date, TGE mechanics, initial distribution, and whether any private/public sale occurred — no official announcement
- Status of FTX Ventures equity in Mysten Labs post-bankruptcy — conflicting reports, no official settlement disclosure
- Sui Foundation grant recipients specifically building on Walrus — no public dashboard filtering for Walrus-specific grants
- Mainnet validator set requirements, staking mechanics, and slashing conditions for storage nodes — detailed specs not published
- Walrus Sites custom domain integration status (beyond SNS) — documentation mentions planned, no timeline
- Audit reports for Walrus core protocol, Seal integration, and Wormhole bridge contracts — not publicly released
- Decentralization roadmap: timeline for permissionless storage node registration, governance parameter control transfer to DAO